sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant Panel as LeetCode panel
  participant App as Local app server
  participant Book as Notebook via coach.py
  participant AI as Claude reply helper
  participant Main as Main coach chat

  You->>Panel: Save reasoning and ask a question
  Panel->>App: Saved stage notes, then question + page/code context
  App->>Book: Save notes and read the current solve
  Book-->>App: Stage, hint level, saved plan and examples
  App->>AI: Question + context + teaching prompts
  AI-->>App: Reply + reported hint level
  App->>Book: Raise saved hint level if needed
  App-->>Panel: Show the reply
  You->>You: Write and run code in LeetCode
  You->>Main: Share final result and ask to record the attempt
  Main->>Book: End solve with outcome, assistance and lesson
  Book-->>Main: Saved attempt and refreshed progress
